                                                "sense_id": "2257498f-788b-31c2-b360-c12cdfaa63e8",
                                                "text": "Even the “unconscious” frequently prefers physical problems to psychological ones as suggested by the prevalence of psychosomatic ailments: physical symptoms--for example, stomach aches--caused by an emotional problem. It has been estimated that more than 50% of a physicians’ practice involves the treatment of psychosomatic complaints."
                                            }
                                        ]
